@startuml
title ATM Scenario 2

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state SelectingAmount
state VerifyingTransaction
state ReenteringAmount

Idle --> SelectingAmount : User Initiates Withdrawal

SelectingAmount --> VerifyingTransaction : Amount Selected / Verify Transaction
VerifyingTransaction --> ReenteringAmount : Transaction Failed / Request to Re-enter Amount
ReenteringAmount --> VerifyingTransaction : User Requests to Re-enter Amount

VerifyingTransaction --> Idle : Transaction Successful / Return to Idle State

SelectingAmount --> Idle : Cancel / Return to Idle State
VerifyingTransaction --> Idle : Cancel / Return to Idle State
ReenteringAmount --> Idle : Cancel / Return to Idle State

@enduml
